[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9980","text":"旁白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9981","text":"LogOnly_与你相遇之后"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9982","text":"LogOnly_我们获得了翅膀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9983","text":"LogOnly_一双非常巨大的翅膀"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9901","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0010","text":"这次就任大使，恭喜您"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0020","text":"谢谢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9902","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0030","text":"作为２８３全体２８人，\n这是第一个大型工作────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9903","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0040","text":"想请您多跟我们聊聊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0050","text":"好的，请多关照"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9984","text":"LogOnly_然后"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9985","text":"LogOnly_找到了属于自己的天空"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0060","text":"……我从没想过\n自己会成为偶像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0070","text":"契机嘛，就是稀里糊涂的～\n也没什么特别的热情"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0080","text":"在那之前完全不知道\n自己竟然还有当偶像的可能性……什么的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0090","text":"哇……\n抱歉，吓到你了吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9986","text":"LogOnly_一点点地，学习飞翔的方法"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0100","text":"……遇到了重要的伙伴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0110","text":"欢笑的时候，哭泣的时候都在一起──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0120","text":"……最喜欢了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9987","text":"LogOnly_一起，学会了飞翔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0130","text":"感受到了世界在不断扩展"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0140","text":"虽然也有辛苦的时候……\n但是……可是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0150","text":"……哈哈，飞得真高啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0160","text":"看起来好舒服──…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0170","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0180","text":"啊—\n未来的事情，谁也不知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0190","text":"──现在？　现在是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0200","text":"嗯\n很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0210","text":"啊，找到了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0220","text":"朝日？\n今天不是休息日────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0230","text":"我来玩了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9988","text":"LogOnly_找到了归属之地"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0231","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0240","text":"比起那个，这个\n是什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0250","text":"是小号啊……\n你从仓库里翻出来的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0260","text":"能给我吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0270","text":"诶？　啊—\n严格来说是公司的备品啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0271","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0280","text":"嗯，在事务所里用的话没问题哦\n不过它睡了很久了，能不能响就不知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0281","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_9989","text":"LogOnly_然后――――――"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0290","text":"今后想做的事，是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0300","text":"想要的东西也行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0310","text":"…………啊—…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0311","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_00_0320","text":"什么都没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0430","text":"在“成为了偶像”之后\n──────────还没有找到想要的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0440","text":"快上"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9983","text":"爱依\\n"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0450","text":"去吧…………！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0460","text":"去吧！！！！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9982","text":"摩美美"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0470","text":"去吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9981","text":"甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0480","text":"去吧──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9980","text":"果穗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0490","text":"去吧…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0500","text":"去吧────────────────────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0015","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0510","text":"听说乌贼啊，\n以前是外星人哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0520","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0530","text":"你想看吧\n看它是不是真的像乌贼那样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0017","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0016","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0540","text":"要去了，那个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0550","text":"穿越天空"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0018","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0560","text":"脱离环绕轨道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0570","text":"比这里\n还要远得多的地方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9979","text":"路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0580","text":"ti ta ta tik tik shake……\npa dun du da────， ah────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9978","text":"声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0590","text":"“好讨厌吧　好丑陋吧　这样的世界”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0600","text":"“即便如此”“为什么”“为了什么”“还要歌唱”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_9977","text":"路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0610","text":"────……膝上………………\n────────……臂弯之中……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0620","text":"我的身边一直有歌"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0630","text":"是歌，让我成为了我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_08_0640","text":"还需要比这更多的答案吗"}]
